{'symbol': 'UHS', 'date': '2023-01-18 16:15:00', 'title': 'UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES, INC. ANNOUNCES DIVIDEND', 'text': 'KING OF PRUSSIA, PA. , JAN. 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- UNIVERSAL HEALTH SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: UHS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS VOTED TO PAY A CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.20 PER SHARE ON MARCH 15, 2023 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MARCH 1, 2023.'}